  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Plotting the diagram of the given function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mo>[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>]</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/dfb3f118-5f30-48af-896b-ba02644a18f6-9886942.png\" style=\"width: 400px; height: 277px;\" /></p><p>Now when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>)</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>And when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>So, from above diagram area can be calculated as,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></msubsup><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></msubsup><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p>",
